    {
      "v": 1,
      "zh": "耶路撒冷的居民立约兰的小儿子亚哈谢接续他作王；因为跟随阿拉伯人来攻营的军兵曾杀了亚哈谢的众兄长。这样，犹大王约兰的儿子亚哈谢作了王。",
      "en": "The residents of Jerusalem[NOTE:1] made his youngest son Ahaziah king in his place, for the raiding party that invaded the camp with the Arabs had killed all the older sons.[NOTE:2] So Ahaziah son of Jehoram became king of Judah.",
