    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "亚哈谢登基的时候年四十二岁（列王下八章二十六节是二十二岁），在耶路撒冷作王一年。他母亲名叫亚她利雅，是暗利的孙女。",
      "en": "Ahaziah was twenty-two[NOTE:1] years old when he became king, and he reigned for one year in Jerusalem. His mother[NOTE:2] was Athaliah, the granddaughter[NOTE:3] of Omri.",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “forty-two,” but some mss of the LXX and the Syriac along with the parallel passage in 2 Kgs 8:26 read “twenty-two.”",
        "Heb “The name of his mother.”",
        "The Hebrew term בַּת (bat, “daughter”) can refer, as here, to a granddaughter. See HALOT 165-66 s.v. I בַּת 1."
      ],
