      "v": 4,
      "zh": "他行耶和华眼中看为恶的事，像亚哈家一样；因他父亲死后有亚哈家的人给他主谋，以致败坏。",
      "en": "He did evil in the sight of[NOTE:1] the Lord like Ahab’s dynasty because, after his father’s death, they[NOTE:2] gave him advice that led to his destruction.",
