    {
      "v": 5,
      "zh": "他听从亚哈家的计谋，同以色列王亚哈的儿子约兰往基列的拉末去，与亚兰王哈薛争战；亚兰人打伤了约兰。",
      "en": "He followed their advice and joined Ahab’s son King Joram[NOTE:1] of Israel in a battle against King Hazael of Syria[NOTE:2] at Ramoth Gilead in which the Syrians defeated Joram.",
