    {
      "v": 7,
      "zh": "亚哈谢去见约兰就被害了，这是出乎　神；因为他到了，就同约兰出去攻击宁示的孙子耶户。这耶户是耶和华所膏、使他剪除亚哈家的。",
      "en": "God brought about Ahaziah’s downfall through his visit to Joram.[NOTE:1] When Ahaziah[NOTE:2] arrived, he went out with Joram to meet Jehu son of Nimshi, whom the Lord had commissioned[NOTE:3] to wipe out Ahab’s family.[NOTE:4]",
      "notes": [
        "Heb “From God was the downfall of Ahaziah by going to Joram.”",
        "Heb “he”; the referent (Ahaziah) has been specified in the translation for clarity.",
        "Heb “anointed.”",
        "Heb “to cut off the house of Ahab.”"
      ],
