      "en": "He looked for Ahaziah, who was captured while hiding in Samaria.[NOTE:1] They brought him to Jehu and then executed him. They did give him a burial, for they reasoned,[NOTE:2] “He is the son of Jehoshaphat, who sought the Lord with his whole heart.” There was no one in Ahaziah’s family strong enough to rule in his place.[NOTE:3]",
